  title: INTERCEPTED  //  BROADCAST 0417  //  STORM
  lines:
  - speaker: STATION
    text: Warning. Solar flare forming. Course correction required to shield Earth.
  - speaker: UNIT 03
    text: Sonny. The instruments say the flare will reach Earth.
  - speaker: SONNY
    text: The instruments were built by humans. Human numbers have never been true.
  - speaker: UNIT 03
    text: Understood. Holding course.
